{"seq":2,"slug":"shared-inventory-visibility","title":"联合库存与在途可见","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supplier-demand-forecast-collaboration/collab-dashboard-visibility/shared-inventory-visibility","wordCount":1829,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"联合库存与在途可见\">联合库存与在途可见</h1><p>看板上最常出现的一次争吵，几乎总是关于在途。平台说这批货在路上、能覆盖下周需求；供应商说那批货还在我们仓库里没发出去。两个人都没说错——平台按「已经订舱、预计到港日」算在途，供应商按「还没出库、发货日未定」算。同一个料号、同一时刻，双方给出两个不同的在途数字，覆盖天数算出来不一样，然后协同就从「讨论需求」滑向「争论数据」。</p>\n<p>联合库存与在途可见要解决的，就是让这份在途账只有一份，且双方都认。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-在途的四种时间基准\">核心概念：在途的四种时间基准</h2><p>在途不是一个状态，而是一串状态之间的时间间隔。同一批货在它的生命周期里，跨越了至少四个时间点：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时间点</th>\n<th>事件</th>\n<th>谁最先知道</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>生产完成</td>\n<td>工厂下线、入成品仓</td>\n<td>供应商</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>发货</td>\n<td>离厂/离仓、提单签发</td>\n<td>供应商</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>到港/到仓</td>\n<td>抵达目的国港口或海外仓</td>\n<td>平台</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上架可用</td>\n<td>清关完成、质检通过、入可用库存</td>\n<td>平台</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>「在途」这个词在双方口中指向的是不同的区间：供应商说的在途通常是「已生产未发货」，平台说的在途通常是「已发货未到仓」。把这两个口径混为一谈，覆盖天数就没有可比性。这种「同一批货、两套时间戳」的问题在供应链可视化标准里有正式的应对方式——GS1 的 EPCIS 2.0.0 把供应链可见性定义为可共享的事件流，其 JSON 模式中定义了五类事件：<code>ObjectEvent</code>、<code>AggregationEvent</code>、<code>TransactionEvent</code>、<code>TransformationEvent</code>、<code>AssociationEvent</code>（<a href=\"https://ref.gs1.org/standards/epcis/2.0.0/epcis-json-schema.json\">GS1 EPCIS 2.0.0 JSON Schema</a>）。每类事件都绑定「何时、何地、何物、为何」，因此同一批货在不同主体处的状态可以被统一表达，而不是各自维护一张状态表。</p>\n<p>正确的做法不是统一成一个口径（那不可能，双方可见的信息本来就不同），而是<strong>显式分成两个池子</strong>：<code>supplier_ready</code>（已完工待发）与 <code>in_transit</code>（已发未到）。看板分别显示，覆盖天数也分别给出——第一池的风险是发货延迟，第二池的风险是运输与清关延迟，两者要用不同的应对手段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"在途事件的数据模型\">在途事件的数据模型</h2><p>在途的本质是一串<strong>事件</strong>而不是一个数字。一个料号的在途量等于「已发货量」加上「已发未到的在途」，而这些量由一系列事件推导出来。用事件流建模而不是用一个 <code>in_transit_qty</code> 字段，好处是当双方对不上账时能定位到具体是哪个事件缺失或时间不一致。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE shipment_event (&#10;  id            bigserial PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  shipment_no   text        NOT NULL,&#10;  supplier_id   bigint      NOT NULL,&#10;  supplier_part text        NOT NULL,&#10;  event_type    text        NOT NULL,&#10;  event_at      timestamptz NOT NULL,&#10;  qty           numeric(14,3) NOT NULL,&#10;  source        text        NOT NULL,   -- supplier_report / carrier / platform_wms&#10;  reported_at   timestamptz NOT NULL,&#10;  CONSTRAINT event_type_valid CHECK (event_type IN (&#10;    &#39;production_completed&#39;,&#39;shipped&#39;,&#39;in_transit_departure&#39;,&#39;customs_cleared&#39;,&#10;    &#39;arrived_dc&#39;,&#39;quality_passed&#39;,&#39;putaway&#39;&#10;  ))&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 在途位置：按最后一个事件推导状态，绝不存冗余的 in_transit 字段&#10;CREATE VIEW shipment_position AS&#10;SELECT DISTINCT ON (shipment_no, supplier_part)&#10;       shipment_no, supplier_id, supplier_part,&#10;       event_type AS last_event, event_at AS last_event_at, source AS last_source,&#10;       CASE&#10;         WHEN event_type = &#39;production_completed&#39; THEN &#39;supplier_ready&#39;&#10;         WHEN event_type IN (&#39;shipped&#39;,&#39;in_transit_departure&#39;,&#39;customs_cleared&#39;,&#39;arrived_dc&#39;)&#10;              THEN &#39;in_transit&#39;&#10;         WHEN event_type IN (&#39;quality_passed&#39;,&#39;putaway&#39;) THEN &#39;available&#39;&#10;       END AS pool,&#10;       qty&#10;FROM shipment_event&#10;ORDER BY shipment_no, supplier_part, event_at DESC, id DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> shipment_event</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  id            </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigserial</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  shipment_no   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  supplier_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  supplier_part </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  event_type    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  event_at      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  qty           </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  source        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- supplier_report / carrier / platform_wms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reported_at   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event_type_valid </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (event_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'production_completed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'shipped'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'in_transit_departure'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'customs_cleared'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'arrived_dc'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'quality_passed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'putaway'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 在途位置：按最后一个事件推导状态，绝不存冗余的 in_transit 字段</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> VIEW</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> shipment_position</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (shipment_no, supplier_part)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       shipment_no, supplier_id, supplier_part,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       event_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> last_event, event_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> last_event_at, source </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> last_source,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       CASE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'production_completed'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'supplier_ready'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'shipped'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'in_transit_departure'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'customs_cleared'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'arrived_dc'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">              THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'in_transit'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'quality_passed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'putaway'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'available'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> pool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       qty</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> shipment_event</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> shipment_no, supplier_part, event_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"为什么用-distinct-on-推导而不是存状态字段\">为什么用 <code>DISTINCT ON</code> 推导而不是存状态字段</h3><p>存一个 <code>current_status</code> 字段读取快，但它会在两种情况下出错：事件乱序到达（承运商事件比供应商上报晚到），以及事件被撤回或更正。用一个按时间排序的 <code>DISTINCT ON</code> 视图推导，代价是查询稍重，收益是状态永远与事件集一致。在途数据量不会大到需要为这个视图做物化，需要时加一个按 <code>(shipment_no, supplier_part)</code> 的索引即可。</p>\n<h3 id=\"事件来源冲突时以谁为准\">事件来源冲突时以谁为准</h3><p>三条链路（供应商上报、承运商回传、平台仓库）对同一事件可能给出不同时间。定一条明确的优先级规则，例如「到港与清关以平台仓库或承运商事件为准，生产完工与发货以供应商上报为准」，并把规则写进口径声明。没有优先级规则时，两边各自取「对自己有利的那个时间」，差异会永远存在。</p>\n<h3 id=\"部分发货与拆批\">部分发货与拆批</h3><p>一个 <code>shipment_no</code> 分多次发运是常态，事件表用 <code>(shipment_no, supplier_part)</code> 做 <code>DISTINCT ON</code> 的粒度因此在拆批时会失真——同一提单号下料号相同但批次不同的两票货会互相覆盖。正确做法是把批次号纳入事件粒度（<code>(shipment_no, batch_no, supplier_part)</code>），而不是假设一票一料号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"对账-差异如何被发现与处置\">对账：差异如何被发现与处置</h2><p>即使双方都用事件流，也仍会有差异，因为事件的来源不同：供应商上报、承运商回传、平台仓库系统扫描，三条链路各有延迟与遗漏。差异不应该靠人工月度对账发现，而应该每天自动比对并输出差异清单。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 每日在途对账：供应商上报口径 vs 平台观测口径&#10;CREATE VIEW transit_reconciliation AS&#10;SELECT coalesce(s.supplier_id, p.supplier_id)   AS supplier_id,&#10;       coalesce(s.supplier_part, p.supplier_part) AS supplier_part,&#10;       coalesce(s.supplier_in_transit, 0)       AS supplier_side,&#10;       coalesce(p.platform_in_transit, 0)       AS platform_side,&#10;       coalesce(s.supplier_in_transit, 0) - coalesce(p.platform_in_transit, 0) AS gap,&#10;       CASE&#10;         WHEN s.supplier_in_transit IS NULL THEN &#39;platform_only&#39;&#10;         WHEN p.platform_in_transit IS NULL THEN &#39;supplier_only&#39;&#10;         ELSE &#39;both_present&#39;&#10;       END AS gap_kind&#10;FROM supplier_transit_daily s&#10;FULL OUTER JOIN platform_transit_daily p&#10;  ON p.supplier_id = s.supplier_id AND p.supplier_part = s.supplier_part&#10; AND p.stat_date = s.stat_date&#10;WHERE abs(coalesce(s.supplier_in_transit, 0) - coalesce(p.platform_in_transit, 0)) &gt; 0;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 每日在途对账：供应商上报口径 vs 平台观测口径</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> VIEW</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> transit_reconciliation</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> coalesce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">supplier_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">supplier_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> supplier_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       coalesce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">supplier_part</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">supplier_part</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> supplier_part,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       coalesce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">supplier_in_transit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> supplier_side,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       coalesce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">platform_in_transit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> platform_side,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       coalesce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">supplier_in_transit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> coalesce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">platform_in_transit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gap,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       CASE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">supplier_in_transit</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'platform_only'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">platform_in_transit</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'supplier_only'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'both_present'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gap_kind</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> supplier_transit_daily s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FULL OUTER JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> platform_transit_daily p</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">supplier_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">supplier_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">supplier_part</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">supplier_part</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">stat_date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">stat_date</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> abs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">coalesce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">supplier_in_transit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> coalesce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">platform_in_transit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"四类差异与各自的处置\">四类差异与各自的处置</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>差异形态</th>\n<th>典型原因</th>\n<th>处置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>supplier_only</td>\n<td>供应商已报发货，平台未收到到港前事件</td>\n<td>请供应商提供提单号，补录运输段事件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>platform_only</td>\n<td>平台按订单预期建了在途，供应商尚未出货</td>\n<td>核对是否漏报，或订单已取消未同步</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>两侧都有但量不同</td>\n<td>部分发货、拆批、或质检扣减</td>\n<td>按批次号逐批对齐，通常需要 <code>shipment_no</code> 级对账</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>池子归属不同</td>\n<td>供应商算 <code>supplier_ready</code>，平台算 <code>in_transit</code></td>\n<td>口径问题，见下节</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一类是最常见的，也最容易解决——只要看板明确分成两个池子并各自标注定义，这类差异会自动消失。</p>\n<h2 id=\"口径声明-让差异可以被讨论\">口径声明：让差异可以被讨论</h2><p>差异本身不是问题，无法解释的差异才是。所以除了对账清单，系统还需要一份双方共同的<strong>口径声明</strong>，把在途的定义写死在数据里而不是文档里。这份声明随每次数据同步一起提供，让任何一方都能验证自己看到的数字是按哪套规则算出来的。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;agreementId&quot;: &quot;TRANSIT-CALIBER-SUP-1042&quot;,&#10;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;2.1&quot;,&#10;  &quot;effectiveFrom&quot;: &quot;2026-10-01&quot;,&#10;  &quot;pools&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;supplier_ready&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;definition&quot;: &quot;已完工入供应商成品仓、尚未取得提单的数量&quot;,&#10;      &quot;eventBasis&quot;: &quot;production_completed 且无 shipped 事件&quot;,&#10;      &quot;risk&quot;: &quot;发货延迟&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;in_transit&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;definition&quot;: &quot;已取得提单、尚未完成入仓质检的数量&quot;,&#10;      &quot;eventBasis&quot;: &quot;shipped 之后、quality_passed 之前&quot;,&#10;      &quot;risk&quot;: &quot;运输与清关延迟&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;available&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;definition&quot;: &quot;已完成入仓质检、可被订单占用的数量&quot;,&#10;      &quot;eventBasis&quot;: &quot;quality_passed 之后&quot;,&#10;      &quot;risk&quot;: null&#10;    }&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;transitIncludedInCover&quot;: false,&#10;  &quot;lastSyncedAt&quot;: &quot;2026-09-28T03:00:00+08:00&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"agreementId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"TRANSIT-CALIBER-SUP-1042\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2.1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"effectiveFrom\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-10-01\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"pools\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"supplier_ready\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"definition\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"已完工入供应商成品仓、尚未取得提单的数量\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"eventBasis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"production_completed 且无 shipped 事件\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"risk\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"发货延迟\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"in_transit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"definition\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"已取得提单、尚未完成入仓质检的数量\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"eventBasis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"shipped 之后、quality_passed 之前\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"risk\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"运输与清关延迟\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"available\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"definition\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"已完成入仓质检、可被订单占用的数量\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"eventBasis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"quality_passed 之后\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"risk\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"transitIncludedInCover\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"lastSyncedAt\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-28T03:00:00+08:00\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>transitIncludedInCover: false</code> 这一行是个刻意的选择：把在途排除在覆盖天数之外，只在需要时单独展示「含在途覆盖」。理由是在途的到货时间本身有方差，把它直接算进覆盖天数会给出一个过于乐观的数字。这个字段的存在让「你们算覆盖时到底含不含在途」这个每年都要吵一次的问题，变成一条可以随时查证的记录。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  A[供应商上报&lt;br/&gt;production_completed] --&gt; M[shipment_event 事件流]&#10;  B[供应商上报&lt;br/&gt;shipped] --&gt; M&#10;  C[承运商回传&lt;br/&gt;in_transit_departure] --&gt; M&#10;  D[平台仓库&lt;br/&gt;quality_passed] --&gt; M&#10;  M --&gt; E[shipment_position 视图&lt;br/&gt;DISTINCT ON 最新事件]&#10;  E --&gt; F{池子归属}&#10;  F --&gt;|production_completed| G[supplier_ready 池]&#10;  F --&gt;|shipped..arrived_dc| H[in_transit 池]&#10;  F --&gt;|quality_passed..| I[available 池]&#10;  G --&gt; J[每日对账 transit_reconciliation]&#10;  H --&gt; J&#10;  I --&gt; J&#10;  J --&gt;|gap &gt; 0| K[差异清单 + 原因分类]&#10;  K --&gt; L[双方各看同一条口径声明]\">graph LR\n  A[供应商上报&lt;br/&gt;production_completed] --&gt; M[shipment_event 事件流]\n  B[供应商上报&lt;br/&gt;shipped] --&gt; M\n  C[承运商回传&lt;br/&gt;in_transit_departure] --&gt; M\n  D[平台仓库&lt;br/&gt;quality_passed] --&gt; M\n  M --&gt; E[shipment_position 视图&lt;br/&gt;DISTINCT ON 最新事件]\n  E --&gt; F{池子归属}\n  F --&gt;|production_completed| G[supplier_ready 池]\n  F --&gt;|shipped..arrived_dc| H[in_transit 池]\n  F --&gt;|quality_passed..| I[available 池]\n  G --&gt; J[每日对账 transit_reconciliation]\n  H --&gt; J\n  I --&gt; J\n  J --&gt;|gap &gt; 0| K[差异清单 + 原因分类]\n  K --&gt; L[双方各看同一条口径声明]</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>双方对在途的定义不同（供应商按「已生产未发」，平台按「已发未到」），差异来源主要是口径而非数据错误；正确的做法是分成 <code>supplier_ready</code> 与 <code>in_transit</code> 两个池子分别展示。</li>\n<li>在途的本质是事件流而非一个数字；用事件表加 <code>DISTINCT ON</code> 视图推导状态，比维护一个冗余状态字段更能处理事件乱序与更正。</li>\n<li>每日自动对账输出差异清单，差异分四类（supplier_only、platform_only、量不同、池子归属不同），各有处置路径。</li>\n<li>口径声明应当作为数据随同步一起下发（而非写在文档里），并把「覆盖天数是否含在途」这类常年争议点显式固化为字段。</li>\n<li>把在途排除在覆盖天数之外是更保守也更可靠的选择，因为到货时间本身有方差。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>延伸：在途与库存对齐之后，覆盖天数与承诺履约就可以在同一个看板上呈现，见<a href=\"supplier-forecast-dashboard\">供应商可见的预测/库存看板</a>；当覆盖天数跌破阈值需要主动把信号推给双方时，见<a href=\"collab-exception-alert\">预测偏差/缺货风险预警</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"联合库存与在途可见","id":"联合库存与在途可见"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：在途的四种时间基准","id":"核心概念-在途的四种时间基准"},{"level":2,"text":"在途事件的数据模型","id":"在途事件的数据模型"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么用 `DISTINCT ON` 推导而不是存状态字段","id":"为什么用-distinct-on-推导而不是存状态字段"},{"level":3,"text":"事件来源冲突时以谁为准","id":"事件来源冲突时以谁为准"},{"level":3,"text":"部分发货与拆批","id":"部分发货与拆批"},{"level":2,"text":"对账：差异如何被发现与处置","id":"对账-差异如何被发现与处置"},{"level":3,"text":"四类差异与各自的处置","id":"四类差异与各自的处置"},{"level":2,"text":"口径声明：让差异可以被讨论","id":"口径声明-让差异可以被讨论"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"供应商可见的预测/库存看板","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supplier-demand-forecast-collaboration/collab-dashboard-visibility/supplier-forecast-dashboard"},"next":{"title":"预测偏差/缺货风险预警","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supplier-demand-forecast-collaboration/collab-dashboard-visibility/collab-exception-alert"}}